Your money stands entirely on its own foundations this year — no planetary help below — and the demanding year tests exactly that. Answer with structure: monthly notes, written agreements, modest schedule, staged changes. Postpone every plan the basic routine does not comfortably carry. Where a habit strains, reset expectations early and calmly instead of quietly hauling extra weight. Give yourself both rest and information. Avoid borrowing next year's calendar against energy you do not hold yet. The slow, documented, drama-free path is this year's practical answer. What steadiness is preserved this year is next recovery's raw material — keep it whole.
